# Camera originals for the August San Diego Zoo edit.
#
# The site serves the 1600px versions under photos/sandiego-zoo/web/. These
# Lightroom exports run 5–58 MB each (~352 MB for the batch) and git keeps
# whatever it is given at full size forever, so they stay on disk only.
#
# Deliberately scoped to this one folder. A blanket DSC*.jpg rule would make
# post-trip.yml silently skip camera originals dropped into a NEW trip folder,
# which is the one path that genuinely needs them committed — CI resizes from
# what it finds in the repo.
#
# The earlier zoo originals here are already tracked and stay that way;
# ignoring a tracked file does nothing.
photos/sandiego-zoo/DSC*.jpg

# Same deal for Giverny: ~493 MB of phone originals, served as 1600px versions
# under photos/giverny/web/. The trailing /*.jpg stops at that one directory
# level, so the web/ subfolder is still tracked.
photos/giverny/*.jpg
